    "29 | **72** is less than **91**, so 91 can only be further right. **low** moves to 11. | go-right | Array of 12 items, 12 slots: 2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 45, 56, 67, 72, 91. mid at index 10. low at index 11. high at index 11. Searching index 11 to 11.",
    "30 | The middle of index 11 to 11 is (11 + 11) ÷ 2 = **11**, rounded down. It holds **91**. | mid | Array of 12 items, 12 slots: 2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 45, 56, 67, 72, 91. mid at index 11. low at index 11. high at index 11. Searching index 11 to 11.",
    "31 | **91** is at index 11. Found it! Checks made: 4. | found | Array of 12 items, 12 slots: 2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 45, 56, 67, 72, 91. mid at index 11. low at index 11. high at index 11. Found 91 at index 11. Searching index 11 to 11.",
