    "40 | **56** is more than **50**, so 50 can only be further left. **high** moves to 7. | go-left | Array of 12 items, 12 slots: 2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 45, 56, 67, 72, 91. mid at index 8. low at index 6. high at index 7. Searching index 6 to 7.",
