    "45 | **low** (8) has passed **high** (7): nothing is left. **50** isn’t here. Checks made: 4. | not-found | Array of 12 items, 12 slots: 2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 45, 56, 67, 72, 91. low at index 8. high at index 7. Nothing left to search.",
    "46 | The range shrank to nothing, so 50 isn’t here. **low** stopped at index 8: where 50 would go to keep order. | - | Array of 12 items, 12 slots: 2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 45, 56, 67, 72, 91.",
    "47 | A miss costs the same few checks as a hit. That’s still **O(log n)**. | - | Array of 12 items, 12 slots: 2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 45, 56, 67, 72, 91. | ⏸ chapter-end",
    "48 | With **duplicates**, plain binary search stops at whichever 7 it lands on first. | - | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12.",
