    "50 | The middle of index 0 to 7 is (0 + 7) ÷ 2 = **3**, rounded down. It holds **7**. | mid | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 3. low at index 0. high at index 7. Searching index 0 to 7.",
    "51 | **7** is at index 3. Found it! Checks made: 1. | found | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 3. low at index 0. high at index 7. Found 7 at index 3. Searching index 0 to 7.",
