    "55 | A **7** at index 3. Remember it, but an earlier one could be to the left: **high** moves to 2. | first-match | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 3. low at index 0. high at index 2. Found 7 at index 3. Searching index 0 to 2.",
    "56 | The middle of index 0 to 2 is (0 + 2) ÷ 2 = **1**, rounded down. It holds **5**. | first-mid | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 1. low at index 0. high at index 2. Found 7 at index 3. Searching index 0 to 2.",
