    "59 | A **7** at index 2. Remember it, but an earlier one could be to the left: **high** moves to 1. | first-match | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 2. low at index 2. high at index 1. Found 7 at index 2. Nothing left to search.",
    "60 | Nothing is left. The **first 7** is the one remembered, at index 2. Checks made: 3. | first-done | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. low at index 2. high at index 1. Found 7 at index 2. Nothing left to search.",
