    "63 | The middle of index 0 to 7 is (0 + 7) ÷ 2 = **3**, rounded down. It holds **7**. | last-mid | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 3. low at index 0. high at index 7. Searching index 0 to 7.",
    "64 | A **7** at index 3. Remember it, but a later one could be to the right: **low** moves to 4. | last-match | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 3. low at index 4. high at index 7. Found 7 at index 3. Searching index 4 to 7.",
    "65 | The middle of index 4 to 7 is (4 + 7) ÷ 2 = **5**, rounded down. It holds **7**. | last-mid | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 5. low at index 4. high at index 7. Found 7 at index 3. Searching index 4 to 7.",
    "66 | A **7** at index 5. Remember it, but a later one could be to the right: **low** moves to 6. | last-match | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 5. low at index 6. high at index 7. Found 7 at index 5. Searching index 6 to 7.",
    "67 | The middle of index 6 to 7 is (6 + 7) ÷ 2 = **6**, rounded down. It holds **9**. | last-mid | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 6. low at index 6. high at index 7. Found 7 at index 5. Searching index 6 to 7.",
    "68 | **9** is more than **7**, so 7 can only be further left. **high** moves to 5. | last-go-left | Array of 8 items, 8 slots: 2, 5, 7, 7, 7, 7, 9, 12. mid at index 6. low at index 6. high at index 5. Found 7 at index 5. Nothing left to search.",
