    "47 | The **load factor** is keys ÷ buckets: here 3 ÷ 4 = 0.75. The fuller the table, the longer its chains. | - | Hash table, 4 buckets, 3 keys, load factor 0.75. Bucket 1: Ann, Ben. Bucket 3: Mia.",
