    "11 | **23** leaves from the front. The next item is the new **front**. | dequeue | Queue of 2 items, 6 slots. Front: 8. Rear: 42. Front to rear: 8, 42.",
    "12 | Front shows **8**, the next to leave, without removing it. | front | Queue of 2 items, 6 slots. Front: 8. Rear: 42. Front to rear: 8, 42.",
    "13 | Enqueue **17**. First, check there’s a free slot. | check-full | Queue of 2 items, 6 slots. Front: 8. Rear: 42. Front to rear: 8, 42.",
    "14 | **17** joins at the **rear**. | enqueue | Queue of 3 items, 6 slots. Front: 8. Rear: 17. Front to rear: 8, 42, 17.",
    "15 | Each one touches a single end, so enqueue, dequeue and front all take **O(1)** time. | - | Queue of 3 items, 6 slots. Front: 8. Rear: 17. Front to rear: 8, 42, 17. | ⏸ chapter-end",
    "16 | A printer handles jobs in the order they were sent. The jobs waiting form a queue. | - | Empty queue, 4 slots.",
